  "notes": [
    "There is no cross-company search: every command needs a company slug (jobs.lever.co/{company}); a 404 means that company doesn't use Lever.",
    "Filter values (location, team, commitment, department) must match the board's labels exactly; list without filters first to see them.",
    "Applying is done by the user at applyUrl (jobs.lever.co/{company}/{postingId}/apply); the CLI does not submit applications."
